        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108632",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The existence of products developed by these and other competitors, as well as products of which we may not currently be aware or that may be developed in the future, could adversely affect the marketability of products developed or sold using QS-21 STIMULON.",
        "start_character": 48401,
        "end_character": 48660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-108632",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-108632-54852e5ba3d5125c",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108632",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are aware of many companies with antibody-based products either approved or in clinical development that target these same biological pathways, including the following:",
