        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-108632",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2009, we entered into an amended and restated technology transfer and supply agreement under which GSK obtained the right to manufacture all of its commercial grade QS-21 requirements.",
